@startuml CU03_Iniciar_Sesion_Multitenant
title Diagrama de Comunicación / Robustez ICONIX - CU03: Iniciar Sesión Multitenant

top to bottom direction
skinparam actorStyle hollow
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #0284c7
skinparam ArrowFontColor #0369a1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10

actor ":Usuario" as Act

package "Frontend (Angular PWA)" {
  boundary ":LoginPageComponent" as LoginUI
  boundary ":SessionService" as SessionSvc
  boundary ":AuthApiService" as AuthApi
}

package "Backend (FastAPI)" {
  control ":AuthRoutes" as AuthR
  control ":AuthSecurity" as Sec
  
  entity ":User" as EntUser
  entity ":Company" as EntComp
  entity ":JwtToken" as EntJwt
}

' -------------------------------------------------------------
' ENLACES Y MENSAJES DE COMUNICACIÓN
' -------------------------------------------------------------

' 1. Actor <--> LoginPageComponent
Act --> LoginUI : 1: selectActor()\n1.2: submit()\n2: submit() [Credenciales inválidas]\n3: submit() [Empresa inactiva]\n4: submit() [Usuario inactivo]

' 2. SELF-LOOP 1 (Normalización en LoginPageComponent)
LoginUI --> LoginUI : 1.1: normalizeEmailInput() [Trim y minúsculas]

' 3. Frontend Boundaries
LoginUI --> SessionSvc : 1.3: login()\n2.1: login()\n3.1: login()\n4.1: login()
SessionSvc --> AuthApi : 1.4: login()\n2.2: login()\n3.2: login()\n4.2: login()
SessionSvc --> LoginUI : 1.12: navigateByUrl() [Redirección según rol]
LoginUI --> Act : 2.6: showErrorToast()\n3.6: showErrorToast()\n4.6: showErrorToast()

' 4. Frontend <--> Backend Controller
AuthApi --> AuthR : 1.5: login()\n2.3: login()\n3.3: login()\n4.3: login()
AuthR --> AuthApi : 1.10: response() [HTTP 200 + token]\n2.5: raise_http_exception() [401 Unauthorized]\n3.5: raise_http_exception() [403 Tenant Suspendido]\n4.5: raise_http_exception() [403 Usuario Desactivado]

' 5. Backend Logic & Entities
AuthR --> EntUser : 1.6: query() [por email]\n4.4: query() [is_active==False]
AuthR --> Sec : 1.7: verify_password()\n1.9: create_access_token()\n2.4: verify_password()
Sec --> EntJwt : create() [Firma token JWT]

AuthR --> EntComp : 1.8: query() [valida tenant ACTIVO]\n3.4: query() [status!=ACTIVO]

' 6. SELF-LOOP 2 (Persistencia de sesión en SessionService)
SessionSvc --> SessionSvc : 1.11: setSession() [localStorage + tokenSignal + userSignal]

@enduml
